.TH PRODBOX_control 1
.SH NAME
prodbox-control \- Local control environment
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B prodbox control
.SH DESCRIPTION
Inspect and prepare the selected local control environment.
.SH SUBCOMMANDS
.TP
\fBstatus\fR
Inspect local control observations
.TP
\fBplan\fR
Render the selected kind configuration
.TP
\fBimport-artifact\fR
Import a declared bootstrap artifact
.TP
\fBdiscard-artifact-staging\fR
Discard the selected artifact staging file
.TP
\fBinspect-node-archive\fR
Inspect the retained OCI node archive
.TP
\fBinspect-image-attempt\fR
Inspect a retained image attempt
.SH EXAMPLES
.TP
No documented examples.
